WEBVTT

﻿1
00:00:20.639 --> 00:00:23.996
GRAB SUN JAE AND RUN

2
00:00:24.076 --> 00:00:26.713
What is it?
JULY 2022

3
00:00:51.169 --> 00:00:53.806
Can I look for something here?

4
00:00:53.886 --> 00:00:55.005
Yes, sure.

5
00:00:56.723 --> 00:00:57.723
Thank you.

6
00:01:03.636 --> 00:01:07.632
Look, is that Ryu Sung Jae?
Why is he digging here?

7
00:01:09.111 --> 00:01:10.709
What did he get?

8
00:01:11.069 --> 00:01:12.867
Either an egg or a pumpkin.

9
00:01:14.905 --> 00:01:18.102
HALF A YEAR LATER
JANUARY 1, 2023

10
00:01:18.981 --> 00:01:21.299
EPISODE 8
Hello. Hello?

11
00:01:21.419 --> 00:01:22.419
Well hello.

12
00:01:25.255 --> 00:01:27.053
So many years. So many years!

13
00:01:27.692 --> 00:01:28.692
So many years.

14
00:01:36.364 --> 00:01:37.483
How cold it is.

15
00:01:40.360 --> 00:01:42.158
It's midnight already, where is she?

16
00:01:43.077 --> 00:01:44.196
So long.

17
00:01:50.909 --> 00:01:54.266
- What's happened?
- Sun Jae! Are you hugging an egg?

18
00:01:54.346 --> 00:01:55.346
What?

19
00:01:58.821 --> 00:02:01.379
- How did you know?
- The reporter called and said,

20
00:02:01.459 --> 00:02:03.896
I saw you with an egg by the Han River.

21
00:02:03.976 --> 00:02:05.654
What are you filming there?

22
00:02:06.693 --> 00:02:08.252
Listen, Tong Seok.

23
00:02:08.971 --> 00:02:10.529
I'm waiting for one person.

24
00:02:10.849 --> 00:02:12.727
But an hour has passed and he’s gone.

25
00:02:12.927 --> 00:02:14.885
- Will he come?
- Has it been an hour?

26
00:02:15.285 --> 00:02:16.843
He probably forgot about the meeting.

27
00:02:17.043 --> 00:02:18.282
When did you agree?

28
00:02:19.281 --> 00:02:21.479
- 15 years ago.
- Anecdote.

29
00:02:21.598 --> 00:02:24.955
In 15 years - that means never,
didn't know?

30
00:02:25.155 --> 00:02:26.713
How naive you are!

31
00:02:28.152 --> 00:02:32.108
- Seriously?
- If there are no more meetings, go home.

32
00:02:32.667 --> 00:02:36.024
They're taking pictures of you. Already posted a photo.
Interesting angle, right?

33
00:02:36.104 --> 00:02:37.104
That's all for now.

34
00:02:58.961 --> 00:03:00.639
Time flies again.

35
00:03:01.758 --> 00:03:03.277
Here's my gift.

36
00:03:04.515 --> 00:03:05.874
Will he be able...

37
00:03:06.593 --> 00:03:09.271
get to you in the future?

38
00:03:10.030 --> 00:03:13.027
I pray that everything works out

39
00:03:13.626 --> 00:03:15.425
while I am writing this letter.

40
00:03:15.944 --> 00:03:18.262
If you're reading this now...

41
00:03:18.901 --> 00:03:20.819
that's what I want to say.

42
00:03:21.618 --> 00:03:22.777
Song Jae...

43
00:03:23.137 --> 00:03:24.256
thank you...

44
00:03:24.935 --> 00:03:26.174
that I didn't give up.

45
00:03:44.036 --> 00:03:45.754
Time flies again.

46
00:03:55.824 --> 00:03:57.023
Wow!

47
00:03:57.143 --> 00:04:01.538
Dear viewers, please
don't forget personal things

48
00:04:01.618 --> 00:04:04.336
- ...in the concert hall.
- What?

49
00:04:04.416 --> 00:04:08.172
- They didn’t report snow.
- Thank you for your attention.

50
00:04:09.451 --> 00:04:10.889
First snow.

51
00:04:11.728 --> 00:04:13.287
Sun Jae will be happy.

52
00:04:14.046 --> 00:04:15.046
What?

53
00:04:34.186 --> 00:04:36.464
Everything is the same as that day!

54
00:04:36.583 --> 00:04:37.583
Really...

55
00:04:38.102 --> 00:04:39.301
No!

56
00:04:39.540 --> 00:04:40.619
No.

57
00:05:04.116 --> 00:05:05.395
"GOOD MOVIE"

58
00:05:12.468 --> 00:05:13.986
PRODUCER LIM SOL

59
00:05:20.420 --> 00:05:21.420
Ton Sok.

60
00:05:21.738 --> 00:05:24.176
Yes? What? What? What?

61
00:05:24.575 --> 00:05:26.294
This girl's name is...

62
00:05:30.090 --> 00:05:31.090
Lim Sol?

63
00:05:32.368 --> 00:05:33.368
Yes.

64
00:05:33.726 --> 00:05:35.445
So do you really know each other?

65
00:05:35.764 --> 00:05:38.162
She said that you will understand everything.

66
00:05:40.839 --> 00:05:42.438
Song Jae! Song Jae!

67
00:06:08.412 --> 00:06:09.930
Don't forget. Near the Han River.

68
00:06:10.010 --> 00:06:13.606
Even if we stop communicating,
be sure to come.

69
00:06:13.766 --> 00:06:15.165
This is Sung Jae!

70
00:06:22.677 --> 00:06:23.916
Sung Jae, over here!

71
00:06:43.536 --> 00:06:45.654
Why do you need to go to the Han River again?

72
00:06:53.846 --> 00:06:56.084
Too much time has passed.

73
00:06:57.323 --> 00:06:58.641
He won't come?

74
00:06:59.560 --> 00:07:00.919
That's great.

75
00:07:42.997 --> 00:07:43.997
Hello?

76
00:07:48.112 --> 00:07:49.191
I'm listening to you.

77
00:07:49.471 --> 00:07:50.471
It's me.

78
00:08:34.945 --> 00:08:35.945
So many years.

79
00:08:39.940 --> 00:08:41.139
And it's true.

80
00:08:42.857 --> 00:08:43.857
Yes.

81
00:08:48.931 --> 00:08:50.370
Why are you standing here?

82
00:08:52.927 --> 00:08:54.006
The car broke down?

83
00:08:55.884 --> 00:08:56.884
No.

84
00:08:59.760 --> 00:09:01.119
I was waiting for you.

85
00:09:03.756 --> 00:09:05.674
How did you know that I was coming?

86
00:09:06.913 --> 00:09:08.352
I felt it.

87
00:09:09.630 --> 00:09:10.989
I might not have noticed you.

88
00:09:14.426 --> 00:09:15.704
You haven't changed.

89
00:09:19.620 --> 00:09:20.979
Well, shall we have some tea?

90
00:09:23.057 --> 00:09:24.057
It's probably too late.

91
00:09:26.214 --> 00:09:28.172
No! Everything is fine.

92
00:09:28.252 --> 00:09:29.371
Song Jae!

93
00:09:31.089 --> 00:09:33.487
I really don't want to disturb you,

94
00:09:33.646 --> 00:09:36.803
but at the after-party everyone had already searched you.

95
00:09:37.483 --> 00:09:42.318
You're the last person he saw
yesterday before his death.

96
00:09:42.597 --> 00:09:44.156
We can't let him go!

97
00:09:45.435 --> 00:09:46.435
Just a minute.

98
00:09:46.913 --> 00:09:47.992
No, don't go!

99
00:09:50.669 --> 00:09:51.828
It is forbidden.

100
00:09:52.827 --> 00:09:53.827
What?

101
00:09:55.544 --> 00:09:58.102
You know, it's just... So...

102
00:09:58.182 --> 00:09:59.500
Sung Jae, huh?

103
00:10:00.020 --> 00:10:01.379
Let's be together!

104
00:10:03.057 --> 00:10:06.014
Tonight let's be together. Me and you!

105
00:10:10.170 --> 00:10:11.369
What do you mean?

106
00:10:13.087 --> 00:10:15.125
What she just said.

107
00:10:15.724 --> 00:10:16.724
You...

108
00:10:18.482 --> 00:10:20.320
...and me. Together?

109
00:10:22.837 --> 00:10:24.555
Stay with me tonight.

110
00:10:30.869 --> 00:10:31.869
Fine.

111
00:10:32.428 --> 00:10:33.428
I'll stay.

112
00:10:34.985 --> 00:10:37.902
Song Jae. And if you are here
will anyone see?

113
00:10:37.982 --> 00:10:39.660
Tell me I won't come.

114
00:10:40.100 --> 00:10:41.100
What?

115
00:10:42.098 --> 00:10:45.135
Stop. Sung Jae, where are you going?

116
00:10:46.693 --> 00:10:47.693
Stop!

117
00:10:53.087 --> 00:10:54.326
- Sit down!
- What?

118
00:10:57.802 --> 00:10:59.680
- I’m sitting down!
- What? Song Jae!

119
00:11:00.559 --> 00:11:01.559
Wait.

120
00:11:21.858 --> 00:11:24.655
How are you?

121
00:11:25.774 --> 00:11:26.774
What do you think?

122
00:11:29.491 --> 00:11:30.609
I think it's good.

123
00:11:31.568 --> 00:11:32.887
So it is.

124
00:11:34.166 --> 00:11:35.844
Are you worried about anything?

125
00:11:36.244 --> 00:11:37.244
Nothing.

126
00:11:38.362 --> 00:11:39.720
This is true?

127
00:11:40.519 --> 00:11:42.238
Are you okay?

128
00:11:43.996 --> 00:11:44.996
How are you?

129
00:11:47.473 --> 00:11:49.990
Well... I live slowly.

130
00:11:50.470 --> 00:11:53.307
My health is good, I found a job.

131
00:11:55.824 --> 00:11:56.824
I'm glad.

132
00:12:06.094 --> 00:12:09.051
Where are we going?

133
00:12:09.251 --> 00:12:11.688
To a place where no one will disturb you and me.

134
00:12:12.408 --> 00:12:13.408
We've arrived.

135
00:12:17.642 --> 00:12:18.761
Hotel?

136
00:12:26.753 --> 00:12:29.590
This is not your first time here. You walk so confidently.

137
00:12:29.670 --> 00:12:32.547
Well, familiar places
I like them better.

138
00:12:32.627 --> 00:12:34.226
What do you like here?

139
00:12:34.306 --> 00:12:35.465
Atmosphere.

140
00:12:35.904 --> 00:12:37.862
What other atmosphere?

141
00:12:39.540 --> 00:12:40.540
LUXURY ROOM

142
00:12:41.698 --> 00:12:42.817
Stop, Sung Jae!

143
00:12:46.454 --> 00:12:47.454
Come on...

144
00:12:49.011 --> 00:12:51.289
Let's go somewhere else?

145
00:12:51.369 --> 00:12:53.007
And what? Don't like it?

146
00:12:53.087 --> 00:12:56.364
No, the question is not whether I like it.

147
00:12:56.444 --> 00:12:57.444
Then go ahead.

148
00:12:58.042 --> 00:13:02.198
Only here we can
get away from everyone.

149
00:13:02.997 --> 00:13:03.997
Song Jae!

150
00:13:06.513 --> 00:13:10.230
Yes. I asked you to stay
with me for the night

151
00:13:10.310 --> 00:13:12.867
but I didn't mean that this night...

152
00:13:13.467 --> 00:13:15.504
So... So... What...

153
00:13:16.304 --> 00:13:19.061
That this night will be hot.

154
00:13:19.500 --> 00:13:20.500
Hot?

155
00:13:21.379 --> 00:13:23.536
Yes, it's hot.

156
00:13:27.532 --> 00:13:31.489
Of course, you and I are not strangers,
and in the past we had something.

157
00:13:31.568 --> 00:13:34.725
Some people, when they meet
former classmates,

158
00:13:34.805 --> 00:13:37.642
skip the intro
and start with conclusions.

159
00:13:38.322 --> 00:13:41.319
Sorry, but I'm sticking to it
old views.

160
00:13:43.117 --> 00:13:44.915
- What did you think?
- Exactly!

161
00:13:45.115 --> 00:13:47.872
I don't blame you for having such thoughts.

162
00:13:48.312 --> 00:13:49.670
We just have different goals.

163
00:13:49.750 --> 00:13:52.707
But adults can meet here.

164
00:13:53.107 --> 00:13:54.346
Of course they can.

165
00:13:54.945 --> 00:13:58.462
But when I asked you to stay,

166
00:13:59.101 --> 00:14:02.817
I really didn't hint at anything.
Sorry.

167
00:14:02.897 --> 00:14:04.575
There's nothing to apologize for.

168
00:14:05.135 --> 00:14:08.771
Come on. Anyway, sorry for confusing you.

169
00:14:12.567 --> 00:14:14.366
Show us to the table.

170
00:14:14.446 --> 00:14:16.244
Certainly. Let's pass.

171
00:14:22.997 --> 00:14:24.236
This is a failure!

172
00:14:24.915 --> 00:14:28.032
That's why I brought you here.

173
00:14:29.031 --> 00:14:31.828
There are simply no people here. Understand?

174
00:14:31.988 --> 00:14:36.943
Understand. I completely forgot
that you are a celebrity.

175
00:14:37.662 --> 00:14:38.901
Why did you come?

176
00:14:42.018 --> 00:14:45.095
I wanted to apologize.

177
00:14:45.574 --> 00:14:49.930
Yesterday I pushed you into the fountain
not because of this movie.

178
00:14:50.250 --> 00:14:51.688
But by chance.

179
00:14:52.128 --> 00:14:54.446
I was in a hurry and didn’t recognize you.

180
00:14:56.803 --> 00:14:57.803
Fine.

181
00:14:58.042 --> 00:14:59.441
You wouldn't even know.

182
00:15:00.360 --> 00:15:01.718
Forget the order.

183
00:15:01.918 --> 00:15:07.153
I called the police about something else.
Sorry. I didn't know it would happen like this.

184
00:15:09.071 --> 00:15:10.270
Everything is fine.

185
00:15:13.467 --> 00:15:17.822
By the way, is that the only reason you were looking for me?

186
00:15:19.341 --> 00:15:21.379
I thought because...

187
00:15:24.655 --> 00:15:26.134
time capsules?

188
00:15:28.252 --> 00:15:29.770
I thought it was her.

189
00:15:30.490 --> 00:15:31.928
Do you still remember?

190
00:15:32.288 --> 00:15:34.925
Did you come that day?

191
00:15:35.005 --> 00:15:36.005
No.

192
00:15:36.364 --> 00:15:38.402
I'm very busy. Usually.

193
00:15:40.559 --> 00:15:43.996
It's good that I didn't come.

194
00:15:46.114 --> 00:15:47.114
And you?

195
00:15:47.792 --> 00:15:48.792
Have you come?

196
00:15:49.910 --> 00:15:52.228
No. And I didn't come.

197
00:15:53.626 --> 00:15:56.464
Well, not in that capsule
nothing important, right?

198
00:15:56.823 --> 00:15:58.142
Is it possible not to look for her?

199
00:16:00.539 --> 00:16:01.578
Can.

200
00:16:02.498 --> 00:16:04.496
My wish has already come true.

201
00:16:07.532 --> 00:16:10.010
I'm very glad that I saw you...

202
00:16:13.207 --> 00:16:14.286
...again.

203
00:16:18.122 --> 00:16:19.680
You look better already.

204
00:16:20.719 --> 00:16:23.796
Since then you have been afraid to look at me.

205
00:16:24.955 --> 00:16:26.074
Since then?

206
00:16:27.473 --> 00:16:28.473
Forget.

207
00:16:29.990 --> 00:16:31.668
You dreamed of becoming a director.

208
00:16:32.108 --> 00:16:33.666
Has your dream come true?

209
00:16:35.704 --> 00:16:38.382
- Come here, here, into the frame!
- Will everyone fit in?

210
00:16:38.462 --> 00:16:41.099
- Hello! We're here!
- Come on, take a photo!

211
00:16:41.299 --> 00:16:44.376
On the count of three! One, two, three!

212
00:16:47.652 --> 00:16:50.290
- For Eclipse!
- Hooray!

213
00:16:52.088 --> 00:16:54.925
- Congratulations!
- Congratulations!

214
00:16:55.445 --> 00:16:59.441
- What great fellows! My God!
- Everyone did a great job!

215
00:16:59.520 --> 00:17:01.479
First concert in five years.

216
00:17:01.558 --> 00:17:03.397
The stage was simply on fire.

217
00:17:03.556 --> 00:17:05.475
Thank you, we love you!

218
00:17:05.634 --> 00:17:07.632
And how they performed! Go crazy!

219
00:17:07.712 --> 00:17:09.830
- I love Eclipse!
- Thank you for singing.

220
00:17:09.910 --> 00:17:13.546
-Where is Sun Jae?
- Instead of the afterparty, did you go to the hotel?

221
00:17:13.826 --> 00:17:15.145
BAEK IN HYUK

222
00:17:17.702 --> 00:17:18.702
Wait.

223
00:17:20.539 --> 00:17:22.977
- Yes.
- You're at the hotel, right?

224
00:17:23.057 --> 00:17:26.653
Someone saw you with a girl
went to the hotel.

225
00:17:26.733 --> 00:17:29.451
Everyone already knows! Immediately after the concert
did you go to see her?

226
00:17:29.650 --> 00:17:32.088
What kind of girl? Tell!

227
00:17:33.407 --> 00:17:36.084
- What do you want?
- Reporters will find out everything by morning,

228
00:17:36.164 --> 00:17:37.203
Well, tell me!

229
00:17:37.443 --> 00:17:40.160
Dispatch spies are already somewhere
They're running around in the hotel.

230
00:17:40.599 --> 00:17:41.599
Bye.

231
00:17:46.513 --> 00:17:47.513
What?

232
00:17:48.791 --> 00:17:51.149
Sorry, but I have to go.

233
00:17:51.229 --> 00:17:52.229
So fast?

234
00:17:52.308 --> 00:17:54.386
We didn't even have time to talk.

235
00:17:54.466 --> 00:17:56.863
The reporters have arrived. You're the first...

236
00:17:58.621 --> 00:18:03.217
No. I'll be the first to leave here
and you calmly finish your drink.

237
00:18:03.656 --> 00:18:05.455
You can't let him go like that!

238
00:18:05.774 --> 00:18:07.093
Sit still!

239
00:18:07.453 --> 00:18:09.091
You will have problems too.

240
00:18:09.810 --> 00:18:11.129
Sun Jae, wait!

241
00:18:17.003 --> 00:18:19.640
Cover your face just in case.

242
00:18:22.158 --> 00:18:24.316
I'll call.

243
00:18:25.554 --> 00:18:26.913
We'll meet again.

244
00:18:27.632 --> 00:18:28.632
Bye.

245
00:18:32.188 --> 00:18:34.426
Hello? Yes.

246
00:18:37.582 --> 00:18:39.101
Thank you.

247
00:18:50.729 --> 00:18:51.768
Wait!

248
00:19:01.558 --> 00:19:04.396
Reporter Kim, you look there, I look here.

249
00:19:04.476 --> 00:19:05.476
Fine.

250
00:19:08.751 --> 00:19:09.751
Who is this?

251
00:19:11.588 --> 00:19:12.588
Here they are!

252
00:19:13.586 --> 00:19:16.583
Song Jae! Song Jae! Here, quickly
faster, faster!

253
00:19:26.733 --> 00:19:28.292
What are you doing? We'll be photographed!

254
00:19:28.372 --> 00:19:31.489
They'll take a photo if you don't sit down. Sit down!

255
00:19:40.120 --> 00:19:41.518
What were you even thinking about?

256
00:19:46.154 --> 00:19:48.671
If there are no photographs, no one will believe it.

257
00:20:04.535 --> 00:20:06.054
What's happening now?

258
00:20:06.134 --> 00:20:07.333
What's going on?

259
00:20:07.413 --> 00:20:09.371
I'm driving, you're sitting next to me.

260
00:20:09.451 --> 00:20:10.451
That's what we're talking about.

261
00:20:10.649 --> 00:20:13.646
You grabbed me and suddenly
dragged into the car.

262
00:20:14.166 --> 00:20:17.682
You're being followed and you're walking alone
so even without a car?

263
00:20:17.762 --> 00:20:19.081
The manager has arrived.

264
00:20:22.358 --> 00:20:25.035
My God. Is it true?
I didn't even notice him.

265
00:20:27.912 --> 00:20:30.430
Since you're already seated, I'll take you home.

266
00:20:30.509 --> 00:20:33.706
I'm a great driver. 10 years without accidents.

267
00:20:35.425 --> 00:20:37.023
You haven't changed.

268
00:20:37.463 --> 00:20:39.421
You are still doing everything headlong.

269
00:20:42.777 --> 00:20:44.855
Let's try not to think now.

270
00:20:50.050 --> 00:20:52.767
To me at a time like this?

271
00:20:57.163 --> 00:20:58.163
For what?

272
00:20:59.001 --> 00:21:00.519
I just...

273
00:21:05.315 --> 00:21:08.511
I want to go to the toilet. Can I come see you?

274
00:21:09.031 --> 00:21:10.031
What?

275
00:21:11.229 --> 00:21:12.627
I want to go to the toilet.

276
