As soon as you get drunk, you go to Sol's house.
10 years have passed!

550
00:40:17.922 --> 00:40:19.361
I won't do it again.

551
00:40:20.200 --> 00:40:21.638
This is the last time.

552
00:40:24.156 --> 00:40:25.235
I'll forget everything.

553
00:40:26.953 --> 00:40:28.551
Okay, come here. Get up.

554
00:40:28.631 --> 00:40:32.188
- Leave me alone.
- Get up! Let's! Don't piss me off!

555
00:40:32.268 --> 00:40:33.626
This is not possible.

556
00:40:33.866 --> 00:40:38.661
You're already 30, but your first love
interferes with building relationships.

557
00:40:39.141 --> 00:40:40.859
- Crap.
- Sad.

558
00:40:41.818 --> 00:40:43.776
What? Song Jae!

559
00:40:43.856 --> 00:40:46.174
Song Jae! Let me go!

560
00:40:46.254 --> 00:40:48.252
Song Jae! What are you doing?

561
00:40:48.332 --> 00:40:49.650
Song Jae! No!

562
00:40:53.686 --> 00:40:55.325
Jerk!

563
00:40:59.361 --> 00:41:00.999
Shut your mouth and wash yourself.

564
00:41:01.359 --> 00:41:02.359
Understood.

565
00:41:03.117 --> 00:41:04.316
I wash myself.

566
00:41:04.835 --> 00:41:07.752
I wash myself. How good.

567
00:41:49.990 --> 00:41:50.990
How are you?

568
00:41:51.349 --> 00:41:52.349
Better?

569
00:41:52.987 --> 00:41:55.425
- You don't go to school.
- Listen, Sung Jae.

570
00:41:58.661 --> 00:41:59.661
Thank you.

571
00:42:00.739 --> 00:42:03.656
I'm really very grateful to you

572
00:42:05.215 --> 00:42:08.412
but when I see you, I remember that day.

573
00:42:10.130 --> 00:42:11.130
I'm scared.

574
00:42:12.887 --> 00:42:14.685
I can't look at you.

575
00:42:27.552 --> 00:42:28.991
This tree...

576
00:42:30.150 --> 00:42:31.988
...not anymore.

577
00:42:32.867 --> 00:42:34.266
I found the capsule.

578
00:42:38.302 --> 00:42:39.780
Here's how.

579
00:42:42.098 --> 00:42:44.735
So, at midnight, January 1st...

580
00:42:44.815 --> 00:42:45.815
I've arrived.

581
00:42:47.772 --> 00:42:48.772
That day...

582
00:42:50.769 --> 00:42:52.128
I'm here.

583
00:43:11.828 --> 00:43:13.746
Sun Jae, I...

584
00:43:44.675 --> 00:43:45.675
Go home.

585
00:43:52.188 --> 00:43:53.746
I came then too.

586
00:43:54.985 --> 00:43:56.024
To you.

587
00:44:03.297 --> 00:44:06.214
But I was a little late.

588
00:44:06.973 --> 00:44:08.412
Confused.

589
00:44:10.170 --> 00:44:12.328
Yes. Probably so.

590
00:44:12.448 --> 00:44:14.086
And, you know...

591
00:44:15.325 --> 00:44:16.325
you...

592
00:44:19.201 --> 00:44:20.639
I liked it.

593
00:44:24.595 --> 00:44:26.633
I couldn't say it then.

594
00:44:27.752 --> 00:44:29.431
Sorry for offending you.

595
00:44:31.588 --> 00:44:33.866
Now these words don't mean anything

596
00:44:34.505 --> 00:44:35.784
but I'm really sorry.

597
00:44:37.502 --> 00:44:40.020
I had no other choice.

598
00:44:40.460 --> 00:44:42.617
There was no choice, really.

599
00:44:43.337 --> 00:44:44.775
You suffered alone!

600
00:44:46.653 --> 00:44:49.091
If we met again...

601
00:44:49.930 --> 00:44:51.369
I would say that.

602
00:44:53.806 --> 00:44:55.724
I liked you too.

603
00:44:56.563 --> 00:44:57.962
I missed you.

604
00:45:00.000 --> 00:45:03.037
I really wanted to see you, Sung Jae.

605
00:45:06.354 --> 00:45:07.552
Like this.

606
00:45:15.145 --> 00:45:16.264
They will see us.

607
00:45:16.663 --> 00:45:18.741
Thanks for the ride. I'll go.

608
00:45:36.244 --> 00:45:39.081
I liked you.

609
00:45:39.201 --> 00:45:42.278
I really wanted to see you, Sung Jae.

610
00:45:42.478 --> 00:45:43.676
Like this.

611
00:46:21.598 --> 00:46:22.877
This means...

612
00:46:25.395 --> 00:46:26.395
you...

613
00:46:28.072 --> 00:46:30.070
felt the same.

614
00:46:30.350 --> 00:46:31.350
Yes?

615
00:46:34.625 --> 00:46:35.984
You say you're bored.

616
00:46:39.381 --> 00:46:40.381
Something...

617
00:46:41.658 --> 00:46:42.658
...changed?

618
00:49:18.182 --> 00:49:20.140
Who... Who... Who's there?

619
00:49:20.340 --> 00:49:22.098
The department sent me!

620
00:49:22.178 --> 00:49:24.695
Did your pipes freeze yesterday?

621
00:49:24.855 --> 00:49:26.054
Yes, exactly.

622
00:49:27.413 --> 00:49:31.489
Yes... Sorry, but can you
come later?

623
00:49:31.568 --> 00:49:35.285
No, I can't. Then there will be no time!

624
00:49:38.841 --> 00:49:40.839
What's the matter? Why is it quiet?

625
00:49:44.715 --> 00:49:45.754
Hello!

626
00:49:47.712 --> 00:49:50.390
It's cold outside. Bye, brother!

627
00:49:52.507 --> 00:49:54.386
- Brother?
- Brother?

628
00:49:57.702 --> 00:50:01.379
Yes. This is my brother, you know him!

629
00:50:01.459 --> 00:50:02.897
What? Senior?

630
00:50:02.977 --> 00:50:04.016
Yes, yes.

631
00:50:04.136 --> 00:50:05.774
I haven't seen him for a long time.

632
00:50:06.054 --> 00:50:07.892
He looked different.

633
00:50:09.011 --> 00:50:10.529
He had surgery!

634
00:50:10.729 --> 00:50:11.968
Plastic.

635
00:50:14.126 --> 00:50:17.562
Go already, brother. Let's.

636
00:50:17.642 --> 00:50:20.080
Bye! Go! Go! Come on in. Here.

637
00:50:23.037 --> 00:50:25.435
- Brother is leaving!
- Okay, brother!

638
00:50:26.394 --> 00:50:27.872
- The truth is leaving!
- Yes!

639
00:50:30.470 --> 00:50:33.187
My God. I haven't been here for a long time.

640
00:51:13.187 --> 00:51:14.865
God. What's happened?

641
00:51:15.265 --> 00:51:16.543
What a noisy car.

642
00:51:17.542 --> 00:51:18.861
First time I see her.

643
00:51:38.482 --> 00:51:39.880
Sorry. Continue.

644
00:51:46.274 --> 00:51:47.274
Come on.

645
00:51:51.748 --> 00:51:53.227
Is it funny to you?

646
00:51:54.985 --> 00:51:57.622
It's funny to you now, right?

647
00:51:59.021 --> 00:52:00.420
What will happen to the film?

648
00:52:10.210 --> 00:52:11.648
RECENT CHALLENGES

649
00:52:16.004 --> 00:52:17.403
Busy, probably.

650
00:52:22.198 --> 00:52:24.116
MOM

651
00:52:24.995 --> 00:52:25.995
Yes, mom.

652
00:52:26.074 --> 00:52:28.751
During lunch, visit Hyun Joo
to the hospital.

653
00:52:28.831 --> 00:52:30.829
She wants to divorce Geum!

654
00:52:31.389 --> 00:52:32.627
What are you saying?

655
00:52:32.707 --> 00:52:35.345
This idiot invested all his money
to a friend's business

656
00:52:35.425 --> 00:52:37.502
and lost half.

657
00:52:37.582 --> 00:52:40.100
Hyun Joo found out and kicked him out onto the street!

658
00:52:40.180 --> 00:52:41.180
What?

659
00:52:47.413 --> 00:52:50.769
Do you really want to get a divorce?

660
00:52:52.088 --> 00:52:53.327
Are you crazy?

661
00:52:53.806 --> 00:52:55.285
This is not a joke.

662
00:52:56.603 --> 00:53:00.400
It’s also not easy for Geum now because of the child.

663
00:53:00.999 --> 00:53:03.237
The family is growing, there is not enough space.

664
00:53:03.796 --> 00:53:06.354
I don't work, I don't have enough money.

665
00:53:06.593 --> 00:53:08.352
I knew this would happen.

666
00:53:11.828 --> 00:53:13.506
I envy you, Sol.

667
00:53:15.225 --> 00:53:16.225
I needed...

668
00:53:16.783 --> 00:53:19.500
go to the same faculty.

669
00:53:19.580 --> 00:53:21.578
Let's study together

670
00:53:21.658 --> 00:53:23.616
would work together.

671
00:53:23.696 --> 00:53:25.335
It would be nice.

672
00:53:27.053 --> 00:53:29.530
But for some reason I decided
get married first.

673
00:53:32.647 --> 00:53:35.365
If you could go back in time

674
00:53:35.804 --> 00:53:37.762
would you marry Geum?

675
00:53:43.317 --> 00:53:46.593
And if I hadn’t come out, would it have been different?

676
00:53:47.073 --> 00:53:48.073
Certainly!

677
00:53:49.471 --> 00:53:51.588
Let's say fate has changed.

678
00:53:52.148 --> 00:53:54.585
But will it really be better than before?

679
00:53:55.145 --> 00:53:57.223
Maybe today you will be happy.

680
00:53:57.303 --> 00:53:58.382
What about tomorrow?

681
00:53:58.781 --> 00:54:01.219
What if something bad happens?

682
00:54:01.459 --> 00:54:04.016
You never know what will happen next.

683
00:54:04.895 --> 00:54:06.733
All you have to do is live.

684
00:54:12.767 --> 00:54:14.406
What's wrong with my baby?

685
00:54:14.805 --> 00:54:15.805
Like this.

686
00:54:16.244 --> 00:54:17.363
Come here.

687
00:54:19.201 --> 00:54:23.157
Even if they take me back to the past...

688
00:54:23.357 --> 00:54:25.754
I will never play with fate.

689
00:54:27.473 --> 00:54:29.151
I wouldn't get married -

690
00:54:29.590 --> 00:54:31.908
I wouldn’t see my bunnies.

691
00:54:51.449 --> 00:54:53.606
THE SECRET OF GLOWING SKIN IS HYDRATION

692
00:55:01.279 --> 00:55:03.037
SUN JAE

693
00:55:08.631 --> 00:55:09.631
Hello?

694
00:55:09.830 --> 00:55:10.830
It's me.

695
00:55:12.268 --> 00:55:13.946
I've been busy in the morning.

696
00:55:14.625 --> 00:55:15.784
Are you at work?

697
00:55:16.743 --> 00:55:17.743
Aren't you tired?

698
00:55:17.902 --> 00:55:19.101
Everything is fine.

699
00:55:19.740 --> 00:55:21.139
So are you busy?

700
00:55:21.219 --> 00:55:23.057
Filming until the evening.

701
00:55:23.217 --> 00:55:24.695
It's clear.

702
00:55:24.775 --> 00:55:27.133
You didn't have time to rest after the concert.

703
00:55:27.213 --> 00:55:28.332
Hard?

704
00:55:28.691 --> 00:55:30.210
Not hard. At all.

705
00:55:30.290 --> 00:55:31.489
You're lying.

706
00:55:31.728 --> 00:55:33.606
Again you keep everything to yourself.

707
00:55:33.886 --> 00:55:35.564
You don't tell anyone.

708
00:55:35.644 --> 00:55:38.881
If it's hard for you, say so.
Otherwise no one will know.

709
00:55:42.877 --> 00:55:43.877
Hello?

710
00:55:44.555 --> 00:55:46.394
Why did you suddenly become silent?

711
00:55:49.431 --> 00:55:50.431
Just.

712
00:55:51.389 --> 00:55:52.389
I'm glad.

713
00:55:58.422 --> 00:56:00.579
By the way, about that capsule.

714
00:56:01.139 --> 00:56:02.258
What's the point?

715
00:56:07.652 --> 00:56:11.928
Let time not stop for you.

716
00:56:12.448 --> 00:56:13.448
Strange.

717
00:56:14.086 --> 00:56:15.086
Why?

718
00:56:16.044 --> 00:56:17.642
When I heard you...

719
00:56:18.641 --> 00:56:20.519
time for the first time in so many years...

720
00:56:21.918 --> 00:56:23.716
started walking again.

721
00:56:24.555 --> 00:56:26.274
- Is it true?
- Yes.

722
00:56:27.592 --> 00:56:28.592
See you tomorrow?

723
00:56:28.831 --> 00:56:30.390
Yes. Come on tomorrow.

724
00:56:30.709 --> 00:56:32.468
No. In the evening?

725
00:56:32.787 --> 00:56:33.787
At what time?

726
00:56:35.664 --> 00:56:36.664
Don't know.

727
00:56:37.183 --> 00:56:38.701
Then it won't work.

728
00:56:39.620 --> 00:56:41.738
No. We'll see you.

729
00:56:42.937 --> 00:56:44.416
It's time for me to go. Bye.

730
00:56:46.254 --> 00:56:47.333
See you.

731
00:56:47.413 --> 00:56:49.930
Song Jae! We're there.

732
00:56:51.169 --> 00:56:53.487
- Understood.
- It's time for you, isn't it?

733
00:56:55.485 --> 00:56:56.485
Wait.

734
00:57:00.240 --> 00:57:02.717
Well? See you later.

735
00:57:02.997 --> 00:57:04.276
Maybe right now?

736
00:57:04.396 --> 00:57:06.673
- What?
- Say you miss me.

737
00:57:06.793 --> 00:57:08.991
And I'll come right away.

738
00:57:10.629 --> 00:57:12.028
Go already!

739
00:57:13.427 --> 00:57:14.427
Bye.

740
00:57:29.650 --> 00:57:30.769
What about this?

741
00:57:31.009 --> 00:57:34.206
Most likely, the mermaid will never be able to
stand on your feet.

742
00:57:34.286 --> 00:57:35.286
We'll have to...

743
00:57:36.723 --> 00:57:39.121
SUN JAE

744
00:57:41.239 --> 00:57:42.957
Sorry. Sorry.

745
00:57:43.037 --> 00:57:44.835
Focus.

746
00:57:46.713 --> 00:57:51.109
I'll improve this point.
So this secret...

747
00:57:55.385 --> 00:57:56.943
Look here!

748
00:58:09.171 --> 00:58:10.809
Goodbye!

749
00:58:25.435 --> 00:58:28.272
The subscriber's phone is switched off. Leave...

750
00:58:28.352 --> 00:58:30.949
Still off? Did something happen?

751
00:58:31.069 --> 00:58:33.467
No. The phone just died.

752
00:58:33.946 --> 00:58:34.946
Look ahead.

753
00:58:39.660 --> 00:58:41.299
My God!

754
00:58:43.257 --> 00:58:45.095
How did she get here?

755
00:58:45.175 --> 00:58:47.253
And they say the security is good.

756
00:58:47.612 --> 00:58:48.931
- She again?
- Yes.

757
00:58:49.371 --> 00:58:53.327
She came in the morning when In Hyuk was sleeping,
and tried to open the door.

758
00:58:53.407 --> 00:58:56.284
Why is she still here? What's up?

759
00:58:56.563 --> 00:58:58.122
I feel bad already.

760
00:58:58.202 --> 00:58:59.441
Hush, hush.

761
00:58:59.720 --> 00:59:01.439
We need to go to the hotel now.

762
00:59:01.958 --> 00:59:03.756
I'll change clothes and go to Sol.

763
00:59:12.587 --> 00:59:14.066
Exactly.

764
00:59:14.146 --> 00:59:16.384
Sung Jae has my car.

765
00:59:32.448 --> 00:59:34.326
Is he back yet?

766
00:59:41.159 --> 00:59:43.516
God. My God. I forgot to turn it on.

767
00:59:59.261 --> 01:00:00.460
SUN JAE

768
01:00:03.776 --> 01:00:08.372
SALT

769
01:00:08.651 --> 01:00:11.089
To leave a message,
press "one"...

770
01:00:11.169 --> 01:00:13.087
Filming is not over.

771
01:00:14.805 --> 01:00:18.641
Where did I leave my car?

772
01:00:20.639 --> 01:00:21.639
Found it!

773
01:01:26.214 --> 01:01:27.413
MISSED CALL FROM SALT

774
01:01:34.885 --> 01:01:35.924
It's not me!

775
01:01:36.324 --> 01:01:37.443
She fell herself.

776
01:01:39.441 --> 01:01:41.319
My God! Everything is fine?

777
01:01:44.036 --> 01:01:45.036
Stand!

778
01:01:49.590 --> 01:01:51.189
This is a fan.

779
01:01:51.309 --> 01:01:52.507
Abnormal.

780
01:01:53.107 --> 01:01:54.426
Abnormal?

781
01:01:54.585 --> 01:01:55.585
Yes.

782
01:02:07.932 --> 01:02:09.850
TON JUICE

783
01:02:12.208 --> 01:02:14.486
- What?
- Sun Jae, what room are you in?

784
01:02:14.565 --> 01:02:15.604
2000.

785
01:02:19.680 --> 01:02:21.558
What? Don't ask if you know.

786
01:02:21.638 --> 01:02:22.638
In terms of?

787
01:02:24.476 --> 01:02:25.476
Isn't that you?

788
01:02:45.614 --> 01:02:47.812
- I caught it!
- Let me go!

789
01:03:08.791 --> 01:03:10.350
When did you run away from home?

790
01:03:11.389 --> 01:03:12.468
A month ago.

791
01:03:12.867 --> 01:03:15.185
How old are you? 15, right?

792
01:03:15.664 --> 01:03:16.823
13.

793
01:03:17.463 --> 01:03:18.463
Sixth grade.

794
01:03:20.659 --> 01:03:23.297
You are very small
but this is a crime.

795
01:03:23.377 --> 01:03:25.694
- Understand?
- I like Sun Jae.

796
01:03:25.774 --> 01:03:27.253
Does this explain everything?

797
01:03:27.732 --> 01:03:30.689
If you like it, why are you doing it then?
are you bothering him?

798
01:03:30.969 --> 01:03:32.967
You can't do that!

799
01:03:39.321 --> 01:03:41.479
Eat, take your time. I'll bring some water.

800
01:03:44.156 --> 01:03:47.313
- God. What's happened?
- Terrifying incident:

801
01:03:47.393 --> 01:03:52.068
in one of the hotels in Seoul on Ryu Seon Jae
attacked by an armed man.

802
01:03:52.268 --> 01:03:54.825
Police are searching for a runaway
from the crime scene.

803
01:03:54.905 --> 01:03:56.583
Reporter Kim speaks.

804
01:03:56.663 --> 01:03:59.021
An accident has occurred
in a five star hotel,

805
01:03:59.101 --> 01:04:01.299
not easy for outsiders to enter.

806
01:04:01.379 --> 01:04:03.297
The victim lost a lot of blood.

807
01:04:03.377 --> 01:04:05.534
He was immediately taken to the hospital.

808
01:04:05.614 --> 01:04:08.172
Ryu Sung Jae is currently undergoing surgery.

809
01:04:08.252 --> 01:04:11.329
According to those found on weapons
fingerprints

810
01:04:11.409 --> 01:04:13.766
police identified
suspect:

811
01:04:13.846 --> 01:04:17.602
Kim, 40, has a previous conviction.
for murder in 2009.

812
01:04:17.682 --> 01:04:20.080
Due to the threat of repeated violation

813
01:04:20.160 --> 01:04:22.917
suspect announced
wanted throughout the country.

814
01:04:27.073 --> 01:04:28.192
But for what?

815
01:04:28.631 --> 01:04:29.750
Why Sung Jae?

816
01:05:07.433 --> 01:05:10.430
Translated and voiced by the studio
"Mobile TV"

817
01:05:10.509 --> 01:05:12.907
commissioned by the online cinema Ivy
in 2024.

